  "note": "Falcon-7b ships a byte-level BPE tokenizer over a 65024-entry vocabulary with no normalizer and no post-processor. Its pre-tokenizer is a Sequence combining Punctuation(Contiguous), ByteLevel(add_prefix_space=false), Digits(individual_digits=false), and Split(pattern=Regex('[0-9][0-9][0-9]')) — a distinct shape from GPT-2 / Qwen2 that exercises the Sequence pre-tokenizer path and the Punctuation / Digits / Split combinators end to end. Adds 12 special tokens (>>TITLE<<, >>ABSTRACT<<, >>INTRODUCTION<<, ..., <|endoftext|>). The 20 cases span empty / ASCII prose / code / CJK / Cyrillic / Hebrew / Arabic / Devanagari / emoji / whitespace / long inputs / Falcon-specific special surface forms. Reference ids come from transformers.AutoTokenizer against the shipped tokenizer.json - pass criterion is byte-for-byte parity.",
